{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09654","headline":"峨眉东脚临江听猿怀二室旧庐 · 岑参","name":"峨眉东脚临江听猿怀二室旧庐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"峨眉烟翠新，昨夜秋雨洗。\n分明峰头树，倒插秋江底。\n久别二室间，图他五斗米。\n哀猿不可听，北客欲流涕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09654.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09654","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}